      "policy_quote": "Exception: customers with `tier` equal to `gold` never pay a cancellation fee (`fee_usd` = 0), regardless of timing.",
      "requirement": "Customer tier is irrelevant here (customer tier is 'standard'), so fee rules apply as stated."
    },
